    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BALL IN THE BOX</strong> Just put the ball in the box</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Designed for <strong>puzzle enthusiasts</strong> of all levels (even if you're new to <strong>physics puzzles</strong>);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Solve 27 puzzles</strong> carefully crafted to challenge your mind and skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a <strong>minimalist</strong>, beautifully designed game environment with geometric shapes and soothing colors;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Focus and concentration</strong> to put the ball in the box;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hard game</strong>, use your skills to win each phase where even <strong>luck and patience</strong> will be your allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feedback sounds only</strong> for a more immersive experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra levels</strong> for highly skilled players looking for an additional challenge;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every aspect of the game was created with <strong>love and craftsmanship</strong>;<br><br>Are you up to the challenge of guiding the ball into the box? Test your skills and enjoy the journey.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BALL IN THE BOX</strong> Just put the ball in the box</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Designed for <strong>puzzle enthusiasts</strong> of all levels (even if you're new to <strong>physics puzzles</strong>);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Solve 27 puzzles</strong> carefully crafted to challenge your mind and skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a <strong>minimalist</strong>, beautifully designed game environment with geometric shapes and soothing colors;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Focus and concentration</strong> to put the ball in the box;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hard game</strong>, use your skills to win each phase where even <strong>luck and patience</strong> will be your allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feedback sounds only</strong> for a more immersive experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra levels</strong> for highly skilled players looking for an additional challenge;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every aspect of the game was created with <strong>love and craftsmanship</strong>;<br><br>Are you up to the challenge of guiding the ball into the box? Test your skills and enjoy the journey.</p></li></ul>",
